# outline_group

Retrieves an existing Outline group. Configure exactly one of `id` or `name`. Both attributes are optional and computed, so the lookup returns the attribute you did not configure as well.

Name lookup compares names exactly and case-sensitively across all result pages. It does not accept substring matches. No exact match or more than one exact match produces an error; use a UUID when names are ambiguous.

ID lookup accepts a group UUID and can read externally synchronized groups. This data source does not manage the group or its memberships and does not expose an `external_id` attribute.

Use an unrestricted admin-owned Outline API key. The data source targets Outline 1.10.1 only.

